{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d3f2b6860b2b4cc5","name":"Pathfinder Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-d3f2b6860b2b4cc5","title":"Pathfinder Talent Trees","revision":18399,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:04:26Z","sha256":"55f56040fb00d3f028aabaa2ea3fd58ef33049f0e95c6034454fcbc0e29c5724","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18399","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Pathfinder%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d3f2b6860b2b4cc5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pathfinder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pathfinder","referenceId":"reference:718c859e23cfdb1e"}," gains an additional Pathfinder Talent. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pathfinder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pathfinder","referenceId":"reference:718c859e23cfdb1e"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the following Pathfinder Talent Trees they wish, but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Pathfinder Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Awareness Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Awareness_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:ef6961de49868acc"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You are exceptionally good at noticing things and avoiding perilous situations.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Survivor Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survivor_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:7605750ff0dedddf"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["As an explorer of dangerous places, you are trained to react to danger swiftly and adroitly, as well as navigate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Difficult Terrain"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Difficult_Terrain"},", and reduce damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Pathfinder Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pathfinder_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:1f4e0e6163f589c9"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You specialize in finding and creating optimal locations from which your allies can fight, and then making sure that they reach those locales safely. In combat, you use your eye for finding secure locations to pick the best spots from which to launch your attacks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
